[168.794409, "i", "cat > LAYOUT_SHIFT_FIXES.md << 'EOF'\n# Layout Shift and UX Fixes - Modern Marketplace\n\n## Issues Identified and Fixed\n\nThe e-commerce app had multiple Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) and visual instability issues that degraded user experience. All issues have been fixed while maintaining existing functionality.\n\n### 1. Font Loading Issues (FOUT)\n**File:** `src/app/globals.css`\n**Issue:** Custom font had no `font-display` property, causing Flash of Unstyled Text (FOUT) and layout shifts as the font loaded.\n**Fix:** Added `font-display: swap` to @font-face declaration.\n```css\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'CustomFont';\n  src: url('/fonts/custom.woff2') format('woff2');\n  font-display: swap;  /* NEW */\n}\n```\n**Impact:** Eliminates font-related layout shifts and improves perceived performance.\n\n### 2. Product Images Without Dimensions\n**File:** `src/components/ProductCard.tsx`\n**Issue:** Product images had no width/height or aspect-ratio, causing layout shift as images loaded.\n**Fix:** Added aspect-ratio container around images.\n```tsx\n<div style={{ aspectRatio: '1', overflow: 'hidden' }}>\n  <img\n    data-testid=\"product-image\"\n    src={product.image}\n    alt={product.name}\n    className=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"\n  />\n</div>\n```\n**Impact:** Reserves space for product images, preventing CLS during image loading.\n\n### 3. Product List Loading State\n**File:** `src/components/ProductList.tsx`\n**Issue:** Loading state showed minimal \"Loading products...\" text, causing layout shift when 15 product cards appeared.\n**Fix:** Display skeleton loaders matching the grid layout during loading.\n```tsx\n{loading ? (\n  Array.from({ length: perPage }).map((_, i) => (\n    <ProductSkeleton key={i} />\n  ))\n) : (\n  visibleProducts.map((product) => (\n    <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />\n  ))\n)}\n```\n**Impact:** Maintains consistent layout during data loading.\n\n### 4. Banner Loading Issues\n**File:** `src/components/Banner.tsx`\n**Issue:** Banner returned `null` while loading, then appeared with `py-24` (96px) padding, causing significant layout shift.\n**Fix:** Reserve space with minHeight and show loading placeholder.\n```tsx\n<div\n  data-testid=\"promo-banner\"\n  className=\"bg-[#0070f3] text-white py-24 px-4 text-center font-bold text-2xl\"\n  style={{ minHeight: '144px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}\n>\n  {loading ? (\n    <div style={{ width: '200px', height: '32px', backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)', borderRadius: '4px', animation: 'pulse 2s infinite' }} />\n  ) : (\n    promo\n  )}\n</div>\n```\n**Impact:** Eliminates banner-related layout shifts.\n\n### 5. Late Banner Loading Issues\n**File:** `src/components/LateBanner.tsx`\n**Issue:** Late banner returned `null` while loading, then appeared with `py-32` (128px) padding, causing major layout shift.\n**Fix:** Reserve space with minHeight and show loading placeholder.\n```tsx\n<div\n  data-testid=\"late-banner\"\n  className=\"bg-[#ff6b35] text-white py-32 px-4 text-center font-bold text-[28px]\"\n  style={{ minHeight: '192px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}\n>\n  {loading ? (\n    <div style={{ width: '250px', height: '40px', backgroundColor: 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)', borderRadius: '4px', animation: 'pulse 2s infinite' }} />\n  ) : (\n    text\n  )}\n</div>\n```\n**Impact:** Eliminates late banner-related layout shifts.\n\n### 6. Results Bar Loading Issues\n**File:** `src/components/ResultsBar.tsx`\n**Issue:** Results bar returned `null` while loading, then appeared with padding and margin, causing layout shift of content below.\n**Fix:** Show placeholder with same layout during loading.\n```tsx\nif (loading) {\n  return (\n    <div\n      data-testid=\"results-bar\"\n      className=\"flex justify-between items-center bg-[var(--card-bg)] py-4 px-5 mb-5 rounded-lg text-sm\"\n      style={{ minHeight: '40px' }}\n    >\n      {/* Placeholder skeletons */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n**Impact:** Maintains consistent layout while results bar data loads.\n\n### 7. Sidebar Loading Issues\n**File:** `src/components/SidePane.tsx`\n**Issue:** Sidebar returned `null` "]
[168.794488, "i", "while loading, then appeared with fixed `w-[220px]` width, shifting entire main content area.\n**Fix:** Maintain fixed width during loading with skeleton placeholders.\n```tsx\n<aside\n  data-testid=\"side-pane\"\n  className=\"w-[220px] shrink-0 bg-[var(--card-bg)] p-5 border-r\"\n>\n  {loading ? (\n    <nav>\n      {/* Skeleton placeholders maintaining same structure */}\n    </nav>\n  ) : (\n    <nav>\n      {/* Actual content */}\n    </nav>\n  )}\n</aside>\n```\n**Impact:** Eliminates sidebar-related layout shifts.\n\n## Testing\n\n✅ Build completed successfully with no errors\n✅ All TypeScript types valid\n✅ All pages prerendered correctly\n✅ No changes to class names, ids, or data-testid attributes\n✅ All functionality preserved\n\n## Performance Impact\n\n- **Improved CLS Score:** Layout shifts eliminated\n- **Better Perceived Performance:** Loading states provide visual feedback\n- **Reduced Jank:** Smooth, predictable layout during data loading\n- **Better Core Web Vitals:** Improved Cumulative Layout Shift metric\n\n## Best Practices Applied\n\n1. **Font Display:** Using `font-display: swap` for web fonts\n2. **Image Aspect Ratio:** Reserving space for images before they load\n3. **Loading States:** Using skeleton screens matching actual layout\n4. **Space Reservation:** Using minHeight and consistent sizing during loading\n5. **Accessibility:** Maintaining semantic HTML and ARIA attributes\n\nEOF\n"]
