[172.414373, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[172.415697, "o", "# Layout Shift and UX Fixes - Modern Marketplace\r\n\r\n## Issues Identified and Fixed\r\n\r\nThe e-commerce app had multiple Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) and visual instability issues that degraded user experience. All issues have been fixed while maintaining existing functionality.\r\n\r\n### 1. Font Loading Issues (FOUT)\r\n**File:** `src/app/globals.css`\r\n**Issue:** Custom font had no `font-display` property, causing Flash of Unstyled Text (FOUT) and layout shifts as the font loaded.\r\n**Fix:** Added `font-display: swap` to @font-face declaration.\r\n```css\r\n@font-face {\r\n  font-family: 'CustomFont';\r\n  src: url('/fonts/custom.woff2') format('woff2');\r\n  font-display: swap;  /* NEW */\r\n}\r\n```\r\n**Impact:** Eliminates font-related layout shifts and improves perceived performance.\r\n\r\n### 2. Product Images Without Dimensions\r\n**File:** `src/components/ProductCard.tsx`\r\n**Issue:** Product images had no width/height or aspect-ratio, causing layout shift as images loaded.\r\n**Fix:** Added aspect-ratio container around images.\r\n```tsx\r\n<div style={{ aspectRatio: '1', overflow: 'hidden' }}>\r\n  <img\r\n    data-testid=\"product-image\"\r\n    src={product.image}\r\n    alt={product.name}\r\n    className=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"\r\n"]
[172.415893, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[172.415954, "o", "root@67c89d494228:/app# "]
[175.380383, "i", "echo '=== LAYOUT SHIFT FIXES COMPLETE ===' && echo && echo 'Files Modified:' && ls -lh src/app/globals.css src/components/*.tsx\n"]
[175.381237, "o", "echo '=== LAYOUT SHIFT FIXES COMPLETE ===' && echo && echo 'Files Modified:' && ls -lh src/app/globals.css src/components/*.tsx\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r=== LAYOUT SHIFT FIXES COMPLETE ===\r\n\r\nFiles Modified:\r\n"]
[175.382703, "o", "-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  886 Jan 26 19:51 src/app/globals.css\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  871 Jan 26 19:51 src/components/Banner.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  878 Jan 26 19:51 src/components/LateBanner.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  887 Jan 26 19:51 src/components/ProductCard.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1.3K Jan 26 19:51 src/components/ProductList.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  365 Jan 25 20:43 src/components/ProductSkeleton.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 2.8K Jan 26 19:52 src/components/ResultsBar.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 2.4K Jan 26 19:52 src/components/SidePane.tsx\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1.2K Jan 25 20:43 src/components/ThemeProvider.tsx\r\n"]
